; Entry.nani — Intro VN de NagaiTabi.
; Apertura narrada (3ª persona) -> Yuina te habla -> nombre -> invitación Yes/No.

@hideUI TitleUI
@stopBgm fade:0.5
@processInput set:Pause.false,Rollback.false

; --- 1. Negro inicial ---
@back OkinawaSunset tint:black time:0
@sfx OceanSound Time:2 volume:0.4 loop!
@sfx CricketsFireflies Time:2 volume:0.4 loop!
@showPrinter YuinaIntroPrinter
@printer YuinaIntroPrinter default! !hideOther

; --- 2. Narración sobre negro ---
Okinawa. The southern edge of the line, where the journey of learning Japanese is said to begin.
Somewhere far off, the sea breathed calmly against the shore. The busy platform was unusually quiet.

; --- 3. Fundido al atardecer ---
@back OkinawaSunset tint:white time:3 wait!
@bgm LaCancionDelPollo

; --- 4. La escena ---
The train sat still on the tracks. Out of service, it seemed.
And yet... it was here. Waiting. As if it knew someone was still coming.

; --- 5. Ella (el CG close-up baja desde arriba a la derecha, fondo detrás) ---
A beautiful, elegant train driver was there, by the wagon's window, watching the sunset by the seashore railroad.

; CG fuera de pantalla (derecha, arriba, invisible), luego baja con fundido.
@char YuinaCG.Look pos:30,110 scale:0.82 tint:#ffffff00 time:2 wait!
@char YuinaCG.Look pos:30,-20 tint:#ffffffff time:2 easing:EaseOutQuad wait!

Her expression was as delicate as the sound of the sea. The wind caressed her hair as if they were acquainted since forever.

; --- 6. El CG se retira (sube y se desvanece) y entra Yuina normal ---
@char YuinaCG.Look pos:30,110 tint:#ffffff00 time:0.8 wait!
@hide YuinaCG time:0


@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5

@set noCount=0
@stopSfx OceanSound
@stopSfx CricketsFireflies

; ================= YUINA HABLA =================
@showPrinter YuinaIntroPrinter
@printer YuinaIntroPrinter default! !hideOther
Yuina: Oh.[-] So it's you...
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
Yuina: Will you go to Wakkanai with me?[-] You might have no idea what that means yet... hehe~

@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5
Yuina: You've decided to set off on an adventure, haven't you?[-] So I'm taking you with me, all the way to Wakkanai.
Yuina: We're in Okinawa right now. The very beginning of the line.

@char Yuina.Serious scale:0.5
Yuina: You see, learning a language is a very long... [-]long journey.
Yuina: This train moves when you move.[-] As long as you log your journey and your hours, it all turns into energy.

; --- El corazón del concepto: por qué te necesita ---
@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
Yuina: I... can't move it on my own, you see.[-] I already know Japanese.
Yuina: There's nothing left for me to learn, so there's no energy in me to give this train.
@char Yuina.Serious scale:0.5
Yuina: But you? You still have a whole horizon ahead of you.[-] Every word you learn pushes us forward.

@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
Yuina: We'll travel across the whole of Japan together, from now on.
@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
Yuina: And I'll make sure this becomes the journey of our lives.

; --- Nombre ---
@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5
Yuina: But first...[-] tell me what you'd like me to call you.

@input PlayerName summary:"Type your name." type:string
@savePlayerName

Yuina: {PlayerName}...
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
Yuina: Yes. That name suits this journey well.

; --- Por qué se siente cerca de ti ---
@char Yuina.Serious scale:0.5
Yuina: You know, {PlayerName}... to learn someone's language[-] is to reach the heart of who they are.
Yuina: It's an intimate thing. Maybe we'll get along if you try hard enough...
Yuina: Just kidding, but it is most certainly a human thing ~

; --- Aviso de que será duro ---
@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
Yuina: There will be times you feel like you're not moving at all.[-] The road may feel long, heavy... even silent.
@char Yuina.Decided scale:0.5
Yuina: But even the greatest journeys[-] begin with a single entry in the log.

; --- Invitación / elección ---
@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5
Yuina: So then, {PlayerName}.[-] Will you go on with me?

# Ask
@choice "Yes, let's go." goto:#Yes
@choice "No." goto:#No
@stop

# Yes
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
Yuina: Hehe~ I knew you would.
@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5
Yuina: Then let me show you the operations panel.[-] From there, your real journey begins.
Yuina: Don't worry. You'll get used to it before you know it.
@wait 0.4
@hideAll
@goto MainTracker

; --- Bucle del "No" ---
# No
@set noCount=noCount+1
@goto #NoThird if:noCount>=3
@goto #NoFirst if:noCount==1
@goto #NoSecond if:noCount==2

# NoFirst
@char Yuina.Worry scale:0.5
Yuina: ...Eh?
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
Yuina: No? Come on, you don't mean that.[-] Let me ask you again.
@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5
Yuina: Will you go on with me?
@goto #Ask

# NoSecond
@char Yuina.Serious scale:0.5
Yuina: ...You're really going to keep saying no?
Yuina: I'll give you one more chance. Choose wisely.
Yuina: Will you go on with me?
@goto #Ask

# NoThird
@char Yuina.Angry scale:0.5
Yuina: Hmph.
@char Yuina.Hehe scale:0.5
Yuina: Fine, fine. I can take a hint.
@char Yuina.Neutral scale:0.5
Yuina: Off you go, then. The train leaves without you.[-] ...Farewell.
@wait 1.5
@quitGame
@stop